p;from=appmsg#imgIndex=6\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u5DE5\u7B14\u753B\uFF1A\u003Cu\u003Ehttps://forms.gle/urAiGT1fi3whLfGX9\u003C/u\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u4EE5\u827A\u517B\u5FC3\uFF0C\u4EE5\u9759\u89C2\u4E16\u754C\u3002\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u671F\u5F85\u4E0E\u60A8\u5728\u6587\u5316\u4E2D\u5FC3\u76F8\u89C1\uFF0C\u5171\u5EA6\u4E00\u6BB5\u6C89\u9759\u800C\u4E30\u76C8\u7684\u827A\u672F\u65F6\u5149\u3002\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u4E0A\u8BFE\u65E5\u671F\u8868\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/KpBbR2xoyypUEiahJPJemibDu0xsFxWXiberM2tkqJMUt0RVDtPNCBSJLicpia1zjc78T2c8S0tktEL82sCDjppmfYDwskjS88GE1Hef6AqgsiaBE/640?wx_fmt=png\u0026amp;from=appmsg#imgIndex=7\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/KpBbR2xoyyq6qa93pO6UKj53c9DLdX1UM3T8H6IIdicl9bhJ2g4VYhibm9QPZetNa2FScxUybfFenqibn5nkEubHbCNwDVyFGTs5DkibibKplUFw/640?wx_fmt=png\u0026amp;from=appmsg#imgIndex=8\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/KpBbR2xoyyrKS87UTwYPd5XzewbZwQB4wBjjxt2CIic3ib41ttVuRyJpfnEwFFlibFJbiaCgWDrgB6HUelAqvTVkj3PGvjQicZq7wktDwL6Ak07I/640?wx_fmt=png\u0026amp;from=appmsg#imgIndex=9\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E2026 Semester 3 Series of Arts Courses\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAs the season gently turns, it is the perfect time to pick up an old passion\u2014or discover something new.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELet the sound of the guzheng bring calm, let the game of Go inspire thoughtful reflection, and let brush and ink create a moment of tranquillity amidst the rhythm of everyday life.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe 2026 Semester 3 Series of Arts Courses is now open for registration, with classes commencing from September 12.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhether you are continuing your learning journey or experiencing these traditional arts for the first time, we warmly welcome you to the China Cultural Centre in Kuala Lumpur\u2014to explore the arts, nurture your creativity, and find your own sense of balance.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u2728\u0026#160;\u003Cstrong\u003ECourses Offered\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuzheng\uFF5CGo\uFF5CChinese Color Painting\uFF5CInk Painting\uFF5CCalligraphy\uFF5CGongbi Painting\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u0026#128226; Limited seats available, on a first-come, first-served basis\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u0026#128226; Open to beginners and learners with prior experience\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u0026#128204;\u0026#160;\u003Cstrong\u003EEnroll Now\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuzheng:\u0026#160;\u003Cu\u003Ehttps://forms.gle/N1TMXr7dVxQgfgat8\u003C/u\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGo:\u0026#160;\u003Cu\u003Ehttps://forms.gle/6iWy5U4ZvnAVg2Lv7\u003C/u\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChinese Color Painting:\u0026#160;\u003Cu\u003Ehttps://forms.gle/xuLzjnGvMDeZFJ9D8\u003C/u\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInk Painting:\u0026#160;\u003Cu\u003Ehttps://forms.gle/hcTDRgbQj4zjR2bs7\u003C/u\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECalligraphy:\u0026#160;\u003Cu\u003Ehttps://forms.gle/Xt7VKmsXRNXj2UxQ9\u003C/u\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGongbi Painting:\u0026#160;\u003Cu\u003Ehttps://forms.gle/urAiGT1fi3whLfGX9\u003C/u\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENourish the mind through art, and observe the world in stillness.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe look forward to welcoming you at the China Cultural Centre for another enriching season of artistic learning and discovery.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cimg src=\u0022https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/KpBbR2xoyyrLicicI3eiayhEJ5AKNEQXlkGDyR39Qf8e0ZA9RQjujPmpTlOoy7Iq3cLXCxZOK52ibWrmVnFpmRgKo8V4ic07xc8g8PBEkGlv5fvY/640?wx_fmt=png\u0026amp;from=appmsg#imgIndex=10\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 /\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u66F4\u591A\u7CBE\u5F69\uFF